1	// Shared plumbing for this pack's checks.
2	//
3	// Deliberately dependency-free, and deliberately NOT importing the sibling
4	// browser-speech pack's copy of the same helpers: a pack composes by declaration,
5	// never by importing another pack's code (pack independence), and a local pack's
6	// check modules must load even when the gitignored canon mount is absent — the
7	// project's own vitest run is exactly that situation.
