1	// Red-first fixtures for the host-page-adaptation pack's checks.
2	//
3	// Every rule is exercised three ways: it must FIRE on a violating source, stay
4	// QUIET on a clean one, and stay quiet on the repo's real extension/src/ tree.
5	// The third case is what makes the pack shippable — a check that only ever saw
6	// its own fixtures is a check nobody has confronted with real code.
7	//
8	// Runs in the project's own vitest (see the .claudinite/local/packs include in
9	// vitest.config.js) and imports nothing from the gitignored canon mount, so it
10	// works in CI exactly as it does locally.
